# Xilonen Furina Xianyun Gorou. ~20s Rot. Xilonen cancels plunge endlag with NAs, since dashes spend Nightsoul. Xilonen bursts every other rotation. Only 6 Geo Plunges, 8 with C1. Gorou skips burst if unavailable. 50% collisions.

# Options listed by DPS
xilonen char lvl=90/90 cons=0 talent=9,9,9;
xilonen add weapon="harbinger" refine=5 lvl=90/90;
#xilonen add weapon="ezpitzal" refine=5 lvl=90/90;
xilonen add set="oc" count=4;
#xilonen add set="longnightsoath" count=4;
xilonen add stats hp=4780 atk=311 def%=0.583 geo%=0.466 cd=0.622;
